sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor Mecanico
    actor Cliente
    participant Frontend as Frontend Angular
    participant Security as JWT / Spring Security
    participant OSController as Controllers de ordem de servico
    participant Iniciar as IniciarServicoUseCase
    participant Estoque as BaixarEstoqueUseCase
    participant ReparoController as ReparoAdicionalController
    participant CriarReparo as CriarReparoAdicionalUseCase
    participant OrcamentoController as OrcamentoController
    participant Decidir as DecidirOrcamentoUseCase
    participant Finalizar as FinalizarServicoUseCase
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    Note over Mecanico, DB: Execucao, reparo adicional, decisao e conclusao

    Mecanico->>Frontend: Inicia servico aprovado
    Frontend ->> Security: PATCH .../servicos/{servicoId}/iniciar + JWT
    Security ->> OSController: Requisicao autorizada
    OSController ->> Iniciar: Inicia servico
    Iniciar ->> Estoque: Consulta e baixa itens
    Estoque ->> DB: Consulta e atualiza estoque
    Iniciar ->> DB: Atualiza servico para EM_EXECUCAO
    Iniciar -->> OSController: OrdemServicoResponse
    OSController -->> Frontend: 202 Accepted
    Mecanico ->> Frontend: Registra reparo adicional
    Frontend ->> Security: POST .../reparos-adicionais + JWT
    Security ->> ReparoController: Requisicao autorizada
    ReparoController ->> CriarReparo: Cria reparo e orcamento complementar
    CriarReparo ->> DB: Persiste reparo pendente e orcamento
    CriarReparo -->> ReparoController: OrcamentoResponse + URL publica
    ReparoController -->> Frontend: 201 Created
    Cliente ->> Frontend: Aprova ou recusa o orcamento
    Frontend ->> Security: POST /public/orcamentos/{id}/aprovar ou /recusar + token
    Security ->> OrcamentoController: Requisicao publica validada
    OrcamentoController ->> Decidir: Decide orcamento por token
    Decidir ->> DB: Valida token e grava decisao
    Decidir ->> DB: Atualiza reparo adicional conforme decisao
    Decidir -->> OrcamentoController: OrcamentoResponse
    OrcamentoController -->> Frontend: 200 OK
    Mecanico ->> Frontend: Finaliza servico
    Frontend ->> Security: PATCH .../servicos/{servicoId}/finalizar + JWT
    Security ->> OSController: Requisicao autorizada
    OSController ->> Finalizar: Finaliza servico
    Finalizar ->> DB: Atualiza servico e status da OS
    Finalizar -->> OSController: OrdemServicoResponse
    OSController -->> Frontend: 202 Accepted
